WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.165
Hello, and welcome to Drone Career Explorer —

00:00:03.165 --> 00:00:08.138
a Future Ready AI learning experience designed for middle school students.

00:00:08.138 --> 00:00:12.659
This course introduces students to the exciting world of drones,

00:00:12.659 --> 00:00:17.180
while helping them explore how technology connects to real careers,

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.893
real industries, and real-world problem solving.

00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:23.392
In the middle school Drone Career Explorer program,

00:00:23.392 --> 00:00:27.328
students learn that drones are more than flying devices.

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:31.702
They are part of larger systems that involve people, technology,

00:00:31.702 --> 00:00:33.451
data, process, and purpose.

00:00:33.451 --> 00:00:38.262
Students begin to understand how all of these parts work together

00:00:38.262 --> 00:00:41.324
to solve problems and create meaningful solutions.

00:00:41.324 --> 00:00:45.652
Students also build an important foundation in safety, responsibility,

00:00:45.652 --> 00:00:47.575
and ethical technology use.

00:00:47.575 --> 00:00:51.422
They explore how drones should be used carefully,

00:00:51.422 --> 00:00:54.307
how data should be handled responsibly,

00:00:54.307 --> 00:00:59.115
and how thoughtful decisions help protect people, privacy, and communities.

00:00:59.115 --> 00:01:04.885
This helps students understand that innovation should always be paired with responsibility.

00:01:04.885 --> 00:01:10.334
Throughout the program, students investigate how drones are transforming industries

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:14.149
such as logistics, infrastructure, mapping, public safety,

00:01:14.149 --> 00:01:16.329
construction, agriculture, and media.

00:01:16.329 --> 00:01:20.143
These examples help students connect classroom learning

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:23.958
to emerging career pathways and future innovation.

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:28.504
The course culminates in a Drone Career Challenge capstone.

00:01:28.504 --> 00:01:31.536
Students apply what they have learned

00:01:31.536 --> 00:01:36.587
to design a responsible drone-enabled solution to a real-world problem.

00:01:36.587 --> 00:01:41.134
They also document their learning through reflections, portfolio evidence,

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:45.175
and career-connected thinking that helps showcase their growth.

00:01:45.175 --> 00:01:48.537
Drone Career Explorer helps students think critically,

00:01:48.537 --> 00:01:50.939
design responsibly, and lead confidently.

00:01:50.939 --> 00:01:55.262
It is a learning experience that blends technology, creativity,

00:01:55.262 --> 00:01:57.663
career exploration, and future-ready skills.

00:01:57.663 --> 00:02:03.427
We are excited to help students discover how drones can support innovation,

00:02:03.427 --> 00:02:07.270
solve problems, and open doors to future opportunities.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:10.632
Thank you for exploring Drone Career Explorer.
